  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Production of Marine Fish Fry in Cuba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is: Increased Cuban and regional aquaculture competence in order to enhance production of local marine fish species by reliable, environmentally sustainable aquaculture methods to achieve maximum benefits for the country and for the region as a whole.</narrative>
  </description>
